{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は朝撮影があって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わってからまいまい、ゆったん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなりん、さゆにゃんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パンケーキ食べました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/24/9726438/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女子！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アプリで地図検索したのに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全く逆方向行って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私とさゆにゃんだけ迷った笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大富豪はちょっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"負けただけだもーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/24/9726438/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っけ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また大富豪したーい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなりんブログででしゃばりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなりんかなりんかなりんかなりんかなりんかなりんかなりんかなりん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなりんのまりちゃ呼びすきー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/24/9726438/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2枚目の写真暗くてわかりづらいけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ろに写ってるのはさゆりんだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/24/9726438/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんのブログに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"月曜から夜更かしの\n桐谷さんの話題が出てたけど\nまりかは桐谷さんの事知ってる？＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/24/9726438/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎週見てる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自転車こいでる桐谷さん眩しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"元気になる！素晴らしい！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/24/9726438/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ夢にまりっかが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でてきたどうしてだろう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/24/9726438/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はおじゃましてました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/24/9726438/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/24/9726438/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はまってるアーティストは？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/24/9726438/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空想委員会さん、パスピエさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バチバチエレキテル挿入歌が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パスピエさんでうへへへ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"録画して見てるの。まいやんかわいい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/24/9726438/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒ゴマバナナジュース"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っておいしいの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/24/9726438/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいしいの！作って飲んでみ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒ごまアイスとか黒ごまプリンとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒ごま系に反応するの私"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/24/9726438/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/24/9726438/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャキイズムのまりおがいたので貼る。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かっこよくないとか言うな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/24/9726438/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日朝早いので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}